      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Drain Bonded Item",
      "actions": "free",
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "Frequency 7 times per day\n\nRequirements Grabble hasn't acted yet on this turn\n\n---\n\nEffect Grabble can cast one prepared spell he has already cast today without spending a spell slot. He must still Cast the Spell and meet the spell's other requirements. He can do this once per day for each of the spell ranks he can cast.",
